    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for saying that. but i don't know how to just \"let it go\"... the guilt is always there. every time i try to fix things it just makes it worse for them. it's like even my presence is part of the problem. sometimes i just think if i wasn't even here, they could finally just breathe and be happy again without worrying about me.",
